* LT1720 Comparator: 1.65 V threshold from resistor divider, pull-up output
* Input held above threshold -> output LOW (~0 V)

.include LT1720.sub

* ---------------- Supply ----------------
VCC  VCC  0  DC 5

* ------------ Threshold divider (5 V -> 1.65 V) ------------
R1   VCC  THR  6.7k
R2   THR  0    3.3k
CBYP THR  0    100n

* ------------ Input signal (held above the 1.65 V threshold) ------------
VIN  IN   0   DC 3.0

* ------------ Comparator ------------
* LT1720 pin order: +IN  -IN  V+  V-  OUT
* IN drives the inverting input so that IN > THR forces OUT low.
XU1  THR  IN  VCC  0  OUT  LT1720

* ------------ Open-drain style pull-up on the output ------------
RPU  VCC  OUT  1k
CL   OUT  0    10p

* ------------ Analysis ------------
.tran 10u 2m 0 1u
.meas TRAN vout_dc AVG V(OUT) FROM=1.5m TO=2m

.backanno
.end
